    "description": "Forward Micro M-Lok AFG: FFFTech/FFFTechnology\n\nA micro AFG, designed for compact PDWs such as:\n\n *Sig MCX Rattler\n *SP5K (if using M-Lok Handguard)\n *CZ Scorpion EVO 3 S2 Pistol Micro\n *Ruger PC Charger\n\nAlso the design works well for AK \"Kink\" builds that use M-Lok forends, as the insertion/removal of mags can be \ndifficult with a full sized foregrip.\n\nThis AFG is angled 70° forwards, legally allowing it to be used on pistols. \n\nComes in four varieties: \n\n *Standard\n *Wrap Ridged\n *Ridged\n *Perforated\n\nPrinter Used: Monoprice Maker Select Plus\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 216C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .14mm\nWall Thickness: .40mm\nWall Perimeters: 4 - 5\nInfill: 25%\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 24%\n\nPrint the AFG upside down.\n\nHardware Needed: \n\n2x M5x10 Hex Socketed Machine Screw/Bolt\n\n2x M-Lok T-Nuts (Be sure both bolt & nut are the same thread pitch.)",
